+/* Linear as it looks after its 2026 refresh: light, near-grayscale chrome in
+   one neutral family (the cool blue cast is gone), a dimmed sidebar that is
+   also the window frame, and the content in an inset white panel with a
+   hairline edge. Color is left only where Linear itself keeps it: the status
+   circles, label dots, avatars, and the indigo accent on the person the story
+   is about.
+
+   Every color is a token here, so the dark theme is one block below
+   (`theme="dark"`, or film.mjs --dark). */
+.ln-stage .ss-stage {
+  --gutter: 30px;
+  --ss-well: #ececeb;
+  --ss-canvas: #f5f5f4;
+  --ss-chrome: #f5f5f4;
