+# Photograph sources
+
+Both photographs are bundled locally. Their Wikimedia Commons file pages
+identify them as dedicated under [CC0 1.0](https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
+They are not covered by the Stageshow source-code MIT license.
+
+| Local file | Original and author | Local changes |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `fuji.jpg` | [Fuji Kawaguchi 465.JPG](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fuji_Kawaguchi_465.JPG), Marion & Christoph Aistleitner | Cropped to a 2:1 view of the mountain and lake, resized to 640 × 320, and JPEG-compressed. |
+| `kawaguchiko.jpg` | [Kawaguchiko, Part III - Kawaguchiko6782.jpg](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kawaguchiko,_Part_III_-_Kawaguchiko6782.jpg), lumoplank | Resized to 440 × 309 and JPEG-compressed. |
+
+The example also displays these files through CSS crops and filters for
+illustrative search-result thumbnails; those thumbnails do not depict every
+place named in the mocked search results.
+
+Source and CC0 status verified against the Commons file pages on 2026-10-25.
+The local images matched the recorded crop/resize operations byte for byte.
