+Consolidation tip `0dddebb633fcff452fcb8571e5ab5956f323f4b3` was merged after the earlier integration. It updates sandbox documentation and UI-capture guidance to describe the fourth vendor delivery's media tools, OCR and Chromium; it does not change application or native code. The guidance is retained, but this merge did not install or independently verify those tools, run browser captures, or validate real audio hardware. The combined desktop unit suite then passed 365 files and 4,222 tests plus four Node tests; CI helper tests passed 436, and workspace type, lint and format checks passed.
